 "description": "The Saffier SC 8m Cabin opens up endless sailing possibilities. Whether you like sailing on lakes, rivers or the open sea, enjoy a spacious ergonomic cockpit and an interior comfortably accommodating four adults. With her classic lines, she combines timeless elegance with the trusted sailing performance and craftsmanship you expect from Saffier Yachts – ready for many beautiful miles ahead.",
 "credits": [
  {
   "label": "Design",
   "value": "R. Hennevanger"
  }
 ],
 "awards": [],
 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "One with the elements",
   "intro": "The Sc 8m Cabin is designed for people who like sailing. Close to the water instead of high on top, the feeling that you are one with the elements.\nFormer dinghy sailors who wants to keep just that feeling but with the comfort of a toilet and cooking facilities, a seaworthy cockpit, lots of space inside and a Yanmar diesel engine or Torqeedo electric engine will certainly appreciate this design.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Comforting and relaxing",
   "intro": "Just as all the other Saffier Yachts the Saffier Sc 8m Cabin can be controlled by one person – on engine or while sailing – alone.\nThe reason why is that the controls for the engine, but also the sheets and halyards of the sails are all in reach of the helmsman who can stay safe in the cockpit while trimming and adjusting the sails. The self-tacking jib makes tacking or gybing a maneuver which the helmsman can decide when to perform without asking his crew to move around in the cockpit. Your family will find the high stability, spacey room inside and functionality of this weekend sailer comforting and relaxing.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Seaworthy, self-righting and self-draining",
   "intro": "The Saffier Sc 8m Cabin is seaworthy, self-righting and has a self draining cockpit.\nWhether you would like to sail in a small lake, hop along the coast or maybe a trip overseas to France, Belgium or Holland, the Saffier Sc 8m Cabin can do it all. And when you really want to explore, the Saffier Sc 8m Cabin is easy trailer behind the car to any destiny you want.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Power your way",
   "intro": "Go fully electric for silent, clean cruising or choose the trusted performance of diesel. You decide how you move.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Timeless beauty",
   "intro": "Elegant lines, perfect proportions, and a classic silhouette. The SC 8m Cabin is pure style, wherever you sail.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Effortless sailing",
   "intro": "Easy to handle, even single-handed. All controls within reach for carefree, confident sailing. Anytime, anywhere.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Cabin comfort",
   "intro": "Spacious, bright, and inviting. The cabin offers everything you need for a relaxing day or a spontaneous night on board.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  }
